TKmKWsH3dXv0xcX\n\nありがとうございます！いつもあなたの作品が大好きです！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/18xlH-VROw9rL5FyjmBtYEM7Dcda2tibI/view", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@0men_kemo/works/28", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1986004921414815744%2FC9kgfF0h.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d3b4b50dc39ba0bfaa281d51127abcb0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1986004921414815744%2FC9kgfF0h.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d3b4b50dc39ba0bfaa281d51127abcb0, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1986004921414815744%2FC9kgfF0h.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4afbbaf733b1bee7199ad225c27f2500 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1986004921414815744%2FC9kgfF0h.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f20d8bdb1d515c79830c06fc2a2e4164 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again lovely! I would love for you to make me a new intro song for my VTuber. I'd really love something comforting but feeling like you are at peace and calm. Good memories and soft vibes!\n\nA mixture of this Breath of Fire - Fate    https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nLuJuT9N36U\n\nAnd a mixture of Chrono Trigger - Peaceful days?    https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wYp_UsDzgxM\n\nMy VTuber reference is below! She is a soft fox mommy goddess who loves her Lumie kits! I will be using this on my streams and in videos of my VTuber.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1wRsRJ45RKLIM5zpCJ3ZlUIBLTlQKPzCh?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@0men_kemo/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1986004921414815744%2FC9kgfF0h.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d3b4b50dc39ba0bfaa281d51127abcb0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1986004921414815744%2FC9kgfF0h.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d3b4b50dc39ba0bfaa281d51127abcb0, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1986004921414815744%2FC9kgfF0h.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4afbbaf733b1bee7199ad225c27f2500 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1986004921414815744%2FC9kgfF0h.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f20d8bdb1d515c79830c06fc2a2e4164 3x", "genre": "music", "nsfw": false, "body": "またまたオーメン!君の音楽が大好きだった。ストリームのBRB画面でも、たくさんの人があなたの曲を気に入っていました。<3\n\nまた作ってくれないかな？\n\nブレスオブザワイルドのミックス https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xCKRI_3q13Q\n\nあとニーアも混ぜてくれないかな https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vSo8XY923qI\n\nハッピーだけどちょっと地味な感じ？ソフト？意味が通じるといいな。私の夢の女神VTuberのためのものです！\n\n彼女はこんな感じで、人々を夢の国へとリラックスさせ、眠らせる。画像は以下。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/sgYrAgI", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@0men_kemo/works/26", "thumbnail_src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1986004921414815744%2FC9kgfF0h.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d3b4b50dc39ba0bfaa281d51127abcb0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1986004921414815744%2FC9kgfF0h.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d3b4b50dc39ba0bfaa281d51127abcb0, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1986004921414815744%2FC9kgfF0h.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4afbbaf733b1bee7199ad225c27f2500 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A